---
---

<section id="engineering" class="py-20 bg-[#0B0D0C] border-t border-[#24322B] relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    {/* Section Header */}
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#151C19] border border-[#7CFF3A]/30 text-xs font-semibold text-[#7CFF3A] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <span>Hardware & Metallurgical Architecture</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        ENGINEERED FOR <br />
        <span class="text-[#7CFF3A]">LONG-TERM PERFORMANCE</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#C7CDD1]">
        Every millimeter of a D-VIEW invisible grill installation is precision-manufactured using high-tensile stainless steel (SS-316 & SS-304 options), extruded architectural aluminum, and vibration-resistant anchorages.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Engineering Showcase Grid */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center mb-16">
      
      {/* Macro Hardware Image */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#24322B] shadow-2xl group">
        <img 
          src="/images/wire-engineering.jpg" 
          alt="Macro detail of SS-316 tensioners and wire rope in anodized aluminum track" 
          class="w-full h-[400px] sm:h-[480px] object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0B0D0C] via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 bg-[#121816]/90 backdrop-blur-md p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#24322B]">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7CFF3A] uppercase tracking-wider block">
            Actual Hardware Detail
          </span>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">
            M6 SS-316 Tensioners in 6063-T6 Extruded Architectural Track
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Hardware Components Breakdown */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4">
        
        <div class="bg-[#121816] p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#24322B]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#1A2420] border border-[#24322B] flex items-center justify-center text-[#7CFF3A] font-bold text-sm">
              01
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-white">Multi-Strand Wire Rope (7×7 Core)</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#C7CDD1] leading-relaxed pl-11">
            Woven from 49 individual micro-filaments of stainless steel (SS-316 & SS-304 options available). Delivers high structural resilience and dependable tension retention per strand.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#121816] p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#24322B]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#1A2420] border border-[#24322B] flex items-center justify-center text-[#7CFF3A] font-bold text-sm">
              02
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-white">Polyamide (Nylon-12) Anti-Abrasion Sheath</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#C7CDD1] leading-relaxed pl-11">
            A high-clarity transparent protective sleeve sealed around the steel core. Resists UV embrittlement, eliminates hand chafing, and prevents salt water accumulation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#121816] p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#24322B]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#1A2420] border border-[#24322B] flex items-center justify-center text-[#7CFF3A] font-bold text-sm">
              03
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-white">6063-T6 Structural Aluminum Profiles</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#C7CDD1] leading-relaxed pl-11">
            Heavy-gauge extruded aluminum base and top tracks with a 25-micron architectural anodized coat. Conceals all mounting fasteners for a sleek, flush appearance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#121816] p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#24322B]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#1A2420] border border-[#24322B] flex items-center justify-center text-[#7CFF3A] font-bold text-sm">
              04
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-extrabold text-white">Engineered Concrete Anchors & Locking Ferrules</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#C7CDD1] leading-relaxed pl-11">
            Fastened into solid concrete lintels with tested expansion anchors at minimum 50mm depth. High-compression locking sleeves maintain permanent wire tension without slackening.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    {/* Thickness Comparison Strip */}
    <div class="bg-[#121816] rounded-2xl border border-[#24322B] p-6 sm:p-8">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#7CFF3A]"></span>
        <span>Standard Thickness Selection Guide</span>
      </h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        
        <div class="bg-[#151C19] p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#24322B]">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-2">
            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-white">2.0 mm</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold">Standard Duty</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#C7CDD1] mb-3">
            Lightweight, high visual clarity. Best for lower floors (G+1 to G+5) and interior atrium balustrades.
          </p>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-[#7CFF3A] font-semibold">
            Tensile Spec: Standard Fall Barrier
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#1A2420] p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#7CFF3A]/60 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(124,255,58,0.1)]">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-2">
            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-[#7CFF3A]">2.5 mm</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#7CFF3A] font-bold uppercase">Most Popular</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#C7CDD1] mb-3">
            The ideal golden standard for multi-story towers (floors 6-20+), aggressive pigeon zones, and active child safety.
          </p>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-[#7CFF3A] font-semibold">
            Tensile Spec: High-Rise Engineered
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#151C19] p-5 rounded-xl border border-[#24322B]">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-2">
            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-white">3.0 mm</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold">Heavy Marine Duty</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#C7CDD1] mb-3">
            Maximum load capacity for coastal penthouse balconies (Vizag Beach Road, Kakinada Port) with severe wind gusts.
          </p>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-[#7CFF3A] font-semibold">
            Tensile Spec: Maximum Coastal Strength
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
